              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Starting Saturday 12th September at LMH Townhouse</strong></p><p>Give your puppy the best start with our relaxed, fully supervised Puppy Socialisation Saturdays.</p><p>In a safe and controlled environment, puppies can play, explore, build confidence and learn positive social skills with other puppies, all under the watchful eye of our experienced LMH carer.</p><p>We keep each session small and personal, with a minimum of 3 and maximum of 5 puppies, and up to two humans per puppy.</p><p><strong>Every Saturday 3pm–4pm &amp; 4pm–5pm · £30 per puppy</strong></p><p>A lovely way for your puppy to make new friends, gain confidence and have some fun along the way.</p><p>Advance booking essential.</p>",
